OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining    
OL,6,Flargely dry with variable cloud and    
OL,7,Fsome clear spells. Chance of wintry    
OL,8,Fshowers, mainly near coastal parts.    
OL,9,FLight winds allowing temperatures to   
OL,10,Ffall, with frost developing in many    
OL,11,Fplaces.                                
OL,13,CMonday:FAnother mainly dry day with    
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and some bright or      
OL,15,Fsunny spells. Remaining rather cold    
OL,16,Fwith generally light winds.            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
