OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:       
OL,6,FTurning cloudier and windier Tuesday,  
OL,7,Fwith rain probably arriving. Cloudy    
OL,8,Fand breezy Wednesday with further rain 
OL,9,Fpossible. Likely drier on Thursday,    
OL,10,Fbut remaining rather cloudy and chilly 
OL,11,Foverall.                               
